# The repository stores text as LF. Windows checkouts keep LF too, so gofmt
# and the CI linter agree on what a file looks like no matter who edited it.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.woff2 binary
*.png    binary
*.jpg    binary
*.ico    binary

# Compiled from web/styles by `go generate ./web`; CI checks it is current.
web/static/app.css linguist-generated
